{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14366","headline":"送顾况归茅山 · 韦夏卿","name":"送顾况归茅山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣代爲迁客，虚皇作近臣。\n法尊称大洞，学浅忝初真。\n鸾凤文章丽，烟霞翰墨新。\n羡君寻句曲，白鹄是三神。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦夏卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14366.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14366","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}